  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 300°F (150°C).",
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the lamb and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the onion, garlic, cumin, salt, and black pepper. Cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Add the tomato paste and stir to combine. Cook for 1 minute.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a 9x13 inch baking dish.",
    "Mix in the crushed allspice and chopped parsley (if using).",
    "Cover the dish with aluminum foil and bake for 30 minutes.",
